1
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:11,320
一隻雞展他的翅一直想欲飛 | Tsi̍t-tsiah ke tián i ê si̍t, it-ti̍t siūnn beh pue | A rooster spreads his wings, longing so desperately to fly

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:18,260
但系伊系一隻雞 | Tān-sī i sī tsi̍t-tsiah ke | But after all he is just a rooster

3
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:25,030
提著阿母啊的情批 | The̍h tio̍h a-bú--ah ê tsîng-phue | Holding a tender letter from his mother

4
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:31,620
系按怎一直跋落地 | Sī án-tsuánn it-ti̍t pua̍h-lo̍h-tē | Why does he keep falling crashing down to the ground?

5
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:39,530
阿母啊 我袂曉講話 | A-bú--ah, guá bē-hiáu kóng-uē | Mother, I don't know how to speak properly

6
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:46,540
講細漢時你教我的話 | Kóng sè-hàn sî lí kà guá ê uē | Speaking the words you taught me as a little child

7
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:53,600
請你予我 擱一擺機會 | Tshiánn lí hōo guá koh tsi̍t-pái ki-huē | Please grant me one more precious opportunity

8
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:59,980
予我對你唱出心內話 | Hōo guá tuì lí tshiùnn-tshut sim-lāi-uē | Let me sing out the innermost feelings in my heart

9
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:07,740
阿母啊 我想袂飛 | A-bú--ah, guá siūnn beh pue | Mother, I want so deeply to fly

10
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:14,880
飛轉去囝仔時兩三歲 | Pue tńg-khì gín-á sî nn̄g-sann huè | Fly back to when I was a kid of two or three years old

11
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:21,970
揣我彼時迸見的紅花 | Tshuē guá hit-sî pòng-kìnn ê âng-hue | Search for that lost red blossom from days gone by

12
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:57,180
種佇你天邊的心肝底 | Tsìng tī lí thinn-pinn ê sim-kuann-té | Plant it deep inside your heart at the far horizon

