看 我台灣人袂曉講台灣話 | Khuànn, guá Tâi-uân-lâng bē-hiáu kóng Tâi-uân-uē | Look, I am Taiwanese yet I cannot speak Taiwanese!

22
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:49,440
一隻雞跋佇深谷底 | Tsi̍t-tsiah ke pua̍h tī tshim kok-té | A rooster fallen into the depths of a canyon

23
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:56,320
到死亦系一隻雞 | Kàu sí ia̍h sī tsi̍t-tsiah ke | Until death he remains just a rooster

24
